        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a5"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts24" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts26">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I feel the closest to you when...</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a6"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts28" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts30">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We're with our kids and we're just having the most fun. We're being silly and we're dancing and we're just like forgot about everything and we're just running around being kids too. So that's, I think, one of the pure joyous moments. And then.. When else do I feel the closest. I feel the closest when we're doing all this stuff together. I mean, it's, you know, we follow in maybe your parents' footsteps of working together and doing all these different things together. And we have become quite inseparable. I couldn't imagine doing any of this without you, you know, like honestly. So I feel the closest to you when we're working together and thriving and other than that breaking it down in the kitchen and dancing with [inaudible] and [inaudible]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a9"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts32" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts34">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What do you think has been our greatest accomplishment thus far as a couple?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a10"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts36" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts39">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Obviously. So easy.They're amazing.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a12"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts44" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts49">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They're amazing. And I just want to teach them to be able to do all this stuff for themselves and believe in themselves, but they're amazing. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a522"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts52" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts53">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They're amazing. They're so special</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a524"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts54" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts55">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a525"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts56" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts57">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a526"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts62" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts63">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a527"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts64" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts65">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a17"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts67" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts69">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[inaudible]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a18"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts72" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts75">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's so hard to remember when we're so in the stream of working and everything, that this is truly our greatest accomplishment because they're incredible. They're incredible, I agree.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a534"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts78" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts79">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a529"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts80" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts81">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a407"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts88" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts90">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>How?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a20"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts92" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts97">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think writing the script made us talk so honestly about our relationship and each other because it is like an extreme version of us. So, like, looking at that and developing the story and looking at our relationship that way is fucking weird because it's like a third-person perspective and you're in it at the same time. But I think it's made us more aware of everything, like our stumbling blocks and what makes us work as a couple. So, I think it's just been a beautiful journey. And, like we said, there's the ying and yang of it all. So, like, we're completely different. I have this inner confidence, but it's in a very thin shell. And your insecurities about takes and things like that would crack that shell. So it was a real challenge navigating a relationship and making a movie at the same time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a531"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts100" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts101">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a532"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts102" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts103">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mm-mmh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a533"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts104" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts105">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a24"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts106" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts119">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We have an idea in our heads on how this works. Like even what we're dealing with today getting evacuated from, you know, yesterday getting evacuated. We have all these different plans and we come from things from such different angles. But somehow it works. I mean, we're in a good position now, thank God, but there's chaos in between. But yeah, I love our partnership. What do you feel I am hesitant to speak about and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a409"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts124" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts126">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, of course.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a538"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts130" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts131">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a539"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts136" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts137">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Mm-mmh.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a540"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts142" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts143">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a541"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts148" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts149">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a31"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts150" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts157">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's super heavy for me. I mean, it feels like, you know established gender roles and all this, and the idea of what it is to be a man and running a household and all these things are very real. And there are lots of insecurities that come up with that. And that role has been flipped, at least in our household, and many others so.. It's just, I think it's something guys struggle with. And I mean, like, yeah, it's it's I think it's not just about finances, it's about power dynamics at play in relationships and how you feel and all these things</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a34"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts160" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts163">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I'm starting to feel like a bitch, next question. I don't like it. I want to move on.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a35"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts166" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts171">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I mean, if you want to talk about it a little more, we can but I just feel like it's very easy for you to say all the theoretical stuff, but it actually really feels. It doesn't feel good. That's why I'm. Of course</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a543"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts172" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts173">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>For sure.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a544"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts174" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts175">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But, but and</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a39"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts178" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts180">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It feels terrible. It feels terrible. I feel like shit that I'm not able to be the</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a40"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts181" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts182">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Head of the household running my family like I saw my dad do. It feels terrible. And I've been working my ass off every single day to make all these things. And I had a belief, you know, we went, we met at a master's program. I had a belief that this stuff was going to work out, that there was going to be earnings from this. And I still believe there are, but it's different. It's not going to be the same way it was. And things have been changing. And so it's just really, not it's not easy to talk about and that's why I wanted to move on and I'd prefer to move on.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a411"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts187" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts189">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Alright, next going?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a42"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts190" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts193">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We can talk about it more. We just don't have to talk about it on camera. I'm not trying to bum you out. I just started to feel uncomfortable.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a546"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts196" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts197">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a44"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts200" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts203">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, so you wanna do it now?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a46"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts208" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts215">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, it didn't feel safe to me when you when you're talking in such a theoretical way that's so cerebral, it's not from the heart. This is something that really affects me every single day. I'm thinking about this. Yeah, but but so then it it doesn't need to be about society and all these things. It really like affects me. So I don't wanna.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a548"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts216" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts217">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But it's just an excuse, it's feel like an excuse.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a48"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts218" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts226">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But that sounds like an article. Like, I don't want to talk about it like an article, like, this really affects me. And that's why I wanted to move on, that's all.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a550"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts230" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts233">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's yours.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a51"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts238" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts240">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think the hardest thing that comes up, and it just sort of did in some ways, is that I get reactive and I feel my emotions really strongly. So I think that's probably one of the hardest things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a52"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts242" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts244">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I think it's just I'm trying to do so much all the time and then I feel like</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a413"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts246" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts249">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I can't</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a54"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts250" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts254">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I can't focus because I have so much getting thrown at me so quickly that I get overwhelmed that way. So I think if there's a way to sort of, I don't want you to have to manage me because I don't want you to have a filter because we do everything so great together. But I think there's a way where I get a lot of anxiety because I want to do good by you. I want to do good by you. And when you send me five texts to do a bunch of different things, then my mind goes in all those directions and I can't focus and I get frazzled. So I don't know if there's a way to manage, but I know it's your nature as well because you have an idea and you're like, oh, I got to get this out because I got to delegate this and make it happen, you know? But there's a way where like everything needs to be right now. And that is really hard for me, and that triggers me. So, I don't know if there's a way for us both to navigate that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a57"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts258" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts266">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>See, I feel like the problem is though, is all the delegating. That's where it feels hard. I feel like you don't see the good things I do. You're so overwhelmed on the list, which I understand you are, and you take on a lot. And I'm so grateful for it, honestly. And you take on so much, and I understand why you're overwhelmed. But some of those things I can't take off your plate, like the things with your family, I can't take those off your plate. I can't do it. I can help you as much as I can, and I do everything I can with the kids. And then I just feel like. You're so quick to tell me what I'm doing wrong all the time. And that's something that I've had in my head since I was a kid. And I don't know, like, but I'm just always being told what I'm doing wrong. And that's what I have a hard time with. I had like a panic attack yesterday because you didn't have service and you're trying to get me to book this Airbnb and you sent me 30 messages about it and I didn't have service and I was trying the best to do it and kept sending me more and more messages and my heart's racing more and more and more as you're doing this and I'm trying to do everything to help you. I'm doing everything in my power to help you and you're still not satisfied and you're still saying you got to do this right now. You got to do this right now. You got to do this right now. And my heart's just racing. I was having a panic attack because I just wanted to help you and I couldn't do it and you're just being critical about it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a61"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts270" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts273">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I would love, I would love, I would love to do that</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a63"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts276" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts281">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's not, it's not, it's not the ask. You're having, you're having, there's a disconnect here. Is it's not the asks. I'm happy to do anything for our family. We said our family is our greatest invention. They're our top, top priority always. I'll do anything for our family. It's just the way it's brought to my attention. It's maybe it's partially in me, but I'm told I am fucking up all the time. And even in this conversation, I'm told I'm fucking up, that I'm not bringing enough to the table. I'm not meeting you where you're at. I'm constantly being told I'm fucking up and I'm not doing enough. And I have a lot of shame and that adds to it and it compounds it. So I just don't feel like it's exactly you're not seeing the side of it from me is I have so much shame about this and you're not acknowledging that side of it. And the way your anxious energy for getting stuff done gives me more and more shame like I experienced yesterday.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a65"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts292" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts296">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But even as you're saying that, you're diminishing me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a66"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts301" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts303">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I do, I appreciate everything you do. Why don't you feel that way?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a558"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts317" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts325">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I just feel like. Do you really see me this way? Do you really see me as someone who just like lays back? Oh, let her do everything. That's not how I am. That's not what I'm trying to do. It reflects so negatively on me. why do you look at me this way? If you look at me this way I don't understand.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a425"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts330" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts332">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think you are so fast because you're so anxious and a force of nature like we've described. You are so fast to get things done that you're mad that people aren't getting things done, but people are slower than you. People don't move like you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a427"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts337" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts341">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But you're so impatient.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a429"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts346" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts348">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You don't give me a chance to do things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a81"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts374" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts376">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I I want to support you in every way. I feel like I don't get the opportunity to try.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a431"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts380" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts384">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because you move too quickly. You're too impatient. You don't give me a chance to succeed.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a83"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts386" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts388">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I move at a different pace than you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a84"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts394" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts396">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We are aware of it and we talk about it. This is how we're very different. There's not a way to resolve it, let's be real here.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a85"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts398" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts400">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[inaudible]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a434"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts406" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts408">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh you have three, so you say.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a87"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts415" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts416">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well just what comes to mind very quickly is when you spoke on the panel and there were all of these like big film executives and distributors and all that shit. But you, first of all, were super charismatic, and like everyone would gravitate to you and was asking you questions, and you were swarmed after the panel. And I was like, fuck, this bitch needs to write a book.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a437"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts418" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts420">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[laugh] And so you did.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a88"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts426" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts430">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But that was really inspiring. But there's been so many moments like that along the way. Watching you act. You're such a natural actor. Watching you write in four days feature film scripts, drafts. I mean, you're just fucking force of nature. I mean, that's probably a title here somewhere. But yeah, yeah. So so yeah, all that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a93"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts441" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts445">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It wasn't even remotely possible.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a94"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts448" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts450">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It is impossible.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a97"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts461" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts464">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, really.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a98"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts469" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts470">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Thank you. All right, in 15 years, when our children are adults, what do you hope they'll see when they watch this conversation?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a104"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts492" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts494">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. And I want them to see how much we love each other. Because it's craziest conversation that's got on a roller coaster, you know what I mean? I want them to see that we always show up for each other and we're willing to have the hard conversation and we're here and we're here for each other and that's not gonna stop.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a105"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts496" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts498">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And we'll be there for them and we'll show them this video in 15 years.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a108"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts502" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts506">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And, and that, no. And that that's what love looks like. That love isn't always roses and chocolate. That's not what relationships and love is. They've got to see that it love's. Coming and coming for the relationship every day. And you know, if you fuck up one day, you try again the next day and do better. And it's all about just trying to do better and showing up and being there for each other.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a565"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts518" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts521">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, I agree</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a114"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts526" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts528">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I love them so much.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a441"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts538" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts540">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What does your love feel like?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a117"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts542" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts546">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Warm, goosey, sweet, affectionate, like touching. Like, I didn't realize my family don't hug each other. My family says lots of love. Like, you're glowing, and you're just full of love and full of energy, and you have a lot of it to give.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a443"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts548" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts553">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That's how it feels, really good. When you're not yelling at me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a568"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts556" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts557">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah [laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a123"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts576" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts579">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Thank you. That's beautiful. Wings? Where'd you come up with that one?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a124"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts582" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts585">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That was good. I don't know. It's not how I feel. I love it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a569"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts590" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts591">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[laugh] I love it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a125"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts593" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts595">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If this were to be our last conversation ever.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a126"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts598" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts600">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[laugh] What would you never want me to forget and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a128"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts606" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts608">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>If this were to be our last conversation ever, what would you want me to never forget and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a447"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts618" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts620">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Beautiful life. [yeah, it has been]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a572"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts624" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts627">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I agree.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a133"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts628" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts631">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I love you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
