    </TIER>
    <TIER LINGUISTIC_TYPE_REF="default-lt" TIER_ID="SPEAKER_01">
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a519"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts8">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[music]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a450"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts10" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts12">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I would want you to never forget.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a521"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts13" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts17">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[music]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a451"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts21" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts23">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>When do you feel the closest to me and why?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a452"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts38" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts42">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They're amazing. I can just cry just thinking about how amazing they are.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a523"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts46" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts47">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They're incredible</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a453"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts51" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts59">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They're amazing. But they're so special. And I think that sometimes it's hard because we're working a lot but I feel like we bring so much joy to their life and we're so happy being with them, and we and I feel like they're such happy kids, and I just hope that we can keep.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a454"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts61" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts71">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It's so important to me that we stay really present and really joyful, even though we're dealing with all of the stress. It's like I want them to but we're also dealing with a lot of excitement. So I think we're very excited a lot too. [inaudible]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a455"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts77" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts83">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>They're incredible, I agree [yeah]. They are, for sure.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a456"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts85" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts87">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>How do you feel making the film You, Me, and Her has changed our relationship in a way neither of us expected?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a530"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts94" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts95">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a457"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts98" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts109">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Well, I think also the other thing that just makes me think of when you're saying that, and one of the things I think we're still working on, but I think is so important, which to me was a big part of what we struggled with on set, is really listening to each other [yeah]. Because I think what happens is that we come from very different places [mm-mmh]. And so it's very easy to like immediately be like, nope, not the way you want to do it, the way I want to do it. Right. Because we're just coming from the opposite place of how we can do it</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a535"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts110" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts111">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a536"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts114" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts115">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a537"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts116" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts117">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a458"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts121" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts123">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think probably the thing that you're most hesitant to speak about or the thing that's the hardest to speak about between us is money. Yeah, of course. Um</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a459"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts129" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts133">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think the part that's really hard, even more than the money piece, because I think the money piece kind of complements this other piece, is that as a woman, as a mom, you're just responsible for so much. And I think that when you already have all of that on your plate, and then you're also more economically</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a460"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts135" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts139">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>in charge or like having to</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a461"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts141" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts145">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>take care of that piece too.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a462"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts147" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts152">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Then it's like it starts to feel like heavy. But then at the same time, I also know that it's heavy for you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a463"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts155" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts161">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE> But I think part of the power dynamic, which is true, I agree that there are power dynamics. I just think the power dynamics is like.. Unfortunately, the money, like the person who has more money drives the power dynamic to some degree. What's strange for us is that it's a shift. We're so used to the other way around, no one even questions it. Like, if a man buys a house and that's where the family lives, and the family isn't like, granted, it's not like you're not involved in decision making. We make all our decisions together, but at the same time, it's just like, I feel like we're just used to.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a542"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts162" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts165">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a464"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts168" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts177">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh it feels a certain way for me too. I'm not talking about the theoretical stuff. It's really a tough thing for me too. [for sure] So I don't think there's anything wrong with talking about let's forget the theoretical. So how does it feel for you? And I'll tell you how it feels for me.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a545"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts184" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts185">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a465"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts195" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts199">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE> I know, but I think that you do always feel uncomfortable when we talk about it. I don't think we have like good conversations about it when we're not on camera because I feel like you also get uncomfortable. [yeah] So it's just like an off-topic conversation always.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a466"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts204" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts207">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, I just, I just, I don't know. Anyway, I thought this was just like a safe space that we could talk about.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a547"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts210" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts211">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Oh me too.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a467"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts214" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts220">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And I said I was just trying to say that I don't think, that I don't think, it's not an excuse, it's just what I'm trying to say is that the things have changed, so it's not like you're alone. It's like I feel like you feel like you're the only person in this position.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a549"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts222" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts223">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a551"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts224" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts225">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a468"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts229" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts232">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't know whose question was that.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a469"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts235" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts237">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What do you feel is the hardest thing for me when it comes to us collaborating? And what's your advice to me in regards to that?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a552"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts252" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts253">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a470"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts257" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts260">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I feel like a lot of really shitty everyday things fall on me all the time. And I feel like whenever I try to delegate them to you, you get really upset or really annoyed because you're busy doing something else. And I've tried doing like a calendar thing. Like, I remember at some point we had like a calendar thing, but then that didn't work. And then at some point, I bought like an agenda thing, but that didn't work. And then you start doing to-dos and like a paper.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a553"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts262" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts263">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>No, I think you do a lot of great things but Ihave so many</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a554"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts264" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts265">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Inaudible</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a471"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts269" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts278">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, but the thing is that what you don't understand is that before I even sent that message, I had been trying to do it for like an hour. And the lady had told me that her house is getting rented. And then I looked around and there was no other houses. I didn't know where we were gonna go. I don't know where we're gonna stay. And I had already figured out our house for that day. And there's so much, I'm handling so many things. And then I just can't. I just hit a wall. It's been an hour. I'm on set. I'm being asked to go back in. I don't know what to do. So then I'm asking you. And I feel like if for me, if I could just be met with like gratitude, if I could just be met with, like, honey, of course, what do you need? Thank you for taking care of like so many things every day. What do you need? If, like, every day you could just be like, hey, honey, what's on your plate today? What can I take off your plate? That would be huge. That would be what would like, even if you can't do it, even if it doesn't work, even if for some reason the machine doesn't work or whatever, it's like, I... You're not faulty if something doesn't work. Things don't work. You coming, you coming so upset that I asked a lot, not always but a lot, it seems that I'm interrupting you. And it feels really hard to think that I'm interrupting you</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a556"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts283" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts285">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, but I feel like.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a557"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts286" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts288">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a473"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts291" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts295">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I'm not, I'm, I agree that I have anxiety. I agree that I have anxiety and I know that I'm impatient and I know that I'm anxious. I am aware of that. But I also think that every time I come in and I'm asking you for something, I don't think you're aware of how many things I already did or for how long I've already tried or what I've already done, before I even ask.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a474"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts299" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts307">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But I'm not diminishing you. I'm just saying I would like to be appreciated for everything I've done. I don't feel that way at all. I feel like you're constantly annoyed that I need help</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a476"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts309" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts311">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I feel like you take for granted, like everything's just going to get resolved. You don't have to worry about it so much because I'm just going to resolve it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a477"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts313" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts315">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think that's how you feel. And I don't think you even mean to do that in a mean way. I think I've just like resolved so many things that you don't think it matters. You're like, if I don't do it, she'll just do it. If I don't answer, she'll just figure it out.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a559"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts320" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts322">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't think that, I don't think it's conscious. I don't think it's</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a479"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts327" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts329">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't think it's conscious. I think it's subconscious.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a480"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts335" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts339">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, but I don't need everyone to move at my pace</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a481"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts343" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts345">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, well I can work on being less impatient. So I can work on that. Okay, how about this?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a482"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts351" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts353">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Okay, let's resolve. Okay, I can work on my patient's level if you can work on your attitude.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a483"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts355" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts357">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Because I think my impatience gives you a lot of anxiety. [yeah] But your attitude makes me really upset.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a484"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts359" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts361">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>You just work on asking me like what?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a485"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts363" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts365">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What you could take off my plate and like really</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a486"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts367" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts369">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Like, kindly trying to help with that, that would be really helpful to me. Maybe that would lower my anxiety. Maybe I would be a less anxious person if I felt.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a487"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts371" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts373">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>like more supported in this way.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a488"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts379" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts383">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>How do you not get the opportunity?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a489"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts391" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts393">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So then how are we gonna resolve that?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a490"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts402" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts405">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE> Yeah, was it me or you?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a491"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts411" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts413">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>When was the moment I inspired you the most?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a492"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts423" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts425">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I did. [yeah]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a560"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts428" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts429">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>[laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a493"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts433" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts435">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And um</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a494"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts437" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts439">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>What is the moment you've inspired me the most? There's been so many moments too. But um definitely when I left you alone for for three days for your birthday, I let you be on your own for three days and we didn't know what was gonna happen with our movie and the strikes were happening and we were feeling really negative about the state of the film industry and and you came back and you had like, I don't know how long, like, business plan of like everything we were gonna do and how we were gonna raise more money and how we were gonna market it and how we were gonna put it out in theaters and how we were. And the craziest part about it is like everything you put in that deck, is happening. [laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a561"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts440" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts443">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>None of this was even, it wasn't even</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a562"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts444" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts449">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was impossible</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a495"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts453" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts455">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It was like so far from anything that seemed like a possibility and</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a496"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts457" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts459">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>manifested it into life like you you wrote it out with so much detail.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
