        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a498"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts477" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts479">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Really good things don't have to be easy all the time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a499"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts481" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts483">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But now we love them so much, and that so much on what it is to work on ourselves and work with each other also has so much to do with how we want to show up for them. And, um,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a500"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts485" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts487">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I hope they see that it's okay to be flawed and it's okay to be human and to make mistakes as long as you can.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a501"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts489" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts491">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Like, show up and be aware, and have the hard conversations so you can keep working through things. That these hard conversations actually. Um, are really important. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a502"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts501" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts503">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And also that they can have a conversation with us.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a503"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts509" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts511">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah. Yeah, I agree. And also, um</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a504"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts513" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts515">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Yeah, just um how much love</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
