        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a513"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts573" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts575">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Your love feels like wings. Like you give me wings [laugh] to like fly and you give me permission to take up a lot of space and it makes me really powerful and really capable and I really appreciate it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
